  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Gallery guide (v.1) presents a satirical essay and graphs that show the representation of women artists in Chelsea. These graphs result from researching 198 Chelsea Galleries. The guide offers a new view of the Chelsea map, which details individual galleries and denotes the representation of women at each gallery by a color code. Distributed at the performance, How Good Are You? on March 11, 2006." --Artists' web site.</subfield>
